---
import Layout from '../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/community/Photo.astro';
import Join from '../components/community/Join.astro';
import Resources from '../components/community/Resources.astro';
import {groupUrl} from '../data/community';
---
<Layout>
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> LOCAL ROOTS. SHARED AMBITION.</span><h1>Build with GHL.<br/>Grow <em>together.</em></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>A home for Bangladesh’s agencies, marketers, and entrepreneurs. Learn from each other. Make real connections. Take your next step.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href={groupUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find your people <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/events">Explore events <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><span class="hero-coordinate">23.8103° N · 90.4125° E <span>DHAKA, BANGLADESH</span></span></div>
<div class="hero-photo"><Photo name="meetup" alt="GHL Bangladesh community members together at the 2026 meetup" eager sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 90vw"/><div class="photo-caption"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> REAL PEOPLE. REAL CONNECTIONS.</span><span>GHL Meetup Bangladesh 2026</span></div><div class="photo-sticker" aria-hidden="true"><span>BETTER</span><strong>together.</strong><svg viewBox="0 0 80 30"><path d="M3 20Q35 30 74 9M62 5L75 8L69 22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div></div>
</section>
<div class="audience-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>A COMMUNITY FOR</span><div>Agency owners <i>✳</i> Marketers <i>✳</i> Developers <i>✳</i> Entrepreneurs</div></div></div>
<section class="section wrap intro" id="community"><div><span class="eyebrow">GOOD PEOPLE. SHARED POSSIBILITIES.</span><h2>You don’t have to<br/>figure it out <em>alone.</em></h2></div><div class="intro-copy"><p class="large-copy">The best next step is often a conversation with someone who gets it.</p><p>We’re a community of people in Bangladesh building with HighLevel. We come together to exchange ideas, share practical knowledge, and turn online connections into real conversations.</p><a href="/community" class="text-link">Get to know the community <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="benefits wrap"><article><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="eyebrow">01 / LEARN</span><h3>Less guesswork.<br/>More know-how.</h3><p>Explore real use cases, ask the questions on your mind, and learn from people working with the same tools.</p></article><article><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span class="eyebrow">02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Meet peers.<br/>Find your people.</h3><p>Swap stories with local agency owners, marketers, and builders. Make connections that go beyond a comment thread.</p></article><article><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="eyebrow">03 / GROW</span><h3>New perspectives.<br/>Bigger possibilities.</h3><p>Build confidence, sharpen your skills, and find fresh approaches to the challenges in your business.</p></article></section>
<section class="section events-section" id="events"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OFFLINE CONNECTIONS. LASTING IMPACT.</span><h2>See you at the<br/><em>next conversation.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/events">Explore our events <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="event-feature"><a href="/events/meetup-2026" class="event-image"><Photo name="conversations" alt="GHL Bangladesh attendees exchanging ideas around a table"/><span class="image-label">FROM THE COMMUNITY</span></a><div class="event-content"><span class="eyebrow">A LOOK BACK</span><h3>GHL Meetup<br/>Bangladesh 2026</h3><p>People, ideas, and a shared interest in building better. Take a look inside our community gathering.</p><a class="text-link" href="/events/meetup-2026">Inside the meetup <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="next-event"><span class="status-dot"></span><div><strong>What’s next?</strong><p>Our next gathering is taking shape. Follow the Facebook group for confirmed dates and details.</p><a href={groupUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get community updates ↗</a></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap resource-section" id="resources"><div><span class="eyebrow">KEEP YOUR MOMENTUM</span><h2>Your next<br/><em>“aha” starts here.</em></h2><p>Useful places to learn, explore, and stay up to date with HighLevel.</p><a href="/resources" class="text-link">Browse resources <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><Resources/></section>
<section class="organizer-band"><div class="wrap organizer-inner"><span class="organizer-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><span class="eyebrow">A LOCAL POINT OF CONNECTION</span><h2>Meet Mehedi Sharif.</h2><p>Helping bring Bangladesh’s GHL community together, one conversation at a time.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Connect with the organizer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<Join/>
</Layout>
